{"id":"torrey:burial","source":"torrey","name":"Burial","slug":"burial","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Probable origin of — Ge 4:9,10.","refs":[["Gen",4,9,4,9],["Gen",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Design of — Ge 23:3,4.","refs":[["Gen",23,3,23,3],["Gen",23,4,23,4]]},{"text":"Family of the dead. — Ge 50:5,6,8; Mt 8:21.","refs":[["Gen",50,5,50,5],["Gen",50,6,50,6],["Gen",50,8,50,8],["Matt",8,21,8,21]]},{"text":"Numbers of friends, &c. — Ge 50:7,9; 2Sa 3:31; Lu 7:12.","refs":[["Gen",50,7,50,7],["Gen",50,9,50,9],["2Sam",3,31,3,31],["Luke",7,12,7,12]]},{"text":"Female friends. — Mr 15:47; Lu 7:13.","refs":[["Mark",15,47,15,47],["Luke",7,13,7,13]]},{"text":"Hired mourners. — Jer 9:17,18.","refs":[["Jer",9,17,9,17],["Jer",9,18,9,18]]},{"text":"Great lamentation at. — Ge 50:10,11; 2Sa 3:31,32.","refs":[["Gen",50,10,50,10],["Gen",50,11,50,11],["2Sam",3,31,3,31],["2Sam",3,32,3,32]]},{"text":"Orations sometimes made at — 2Sa 3:33,34.","refs":[["2Sam",3,33,3,33],["2Sam",3,34,3,34]]},{"text":"Washed before. — Ac 9:37.","refs":[["Acts",9,37,9,37]]},{"text":"Anointed for. — Mt 26:12.","refs":[["Matt",26,12,26,12]]},{"text":"Wound in linen for. — Joh 11:44; 19:40.","refs":[["John",11,44,11,44],["John",19,40,19,40]]},{"text":"Preserved with spices. — Joh 19:39,40.","refs":[["John",19,39,19,39],["John",19,40,19,40]]},{"text":"Sometimes burned before. — 1Sa 31:12.","refs":[["1Sam",31,12,31,12]]},{"text":"Carried on a bier to. — 2Sa 3:31; Lu 7:14.","refs":[["2Sam",3,31,3,31],["Luke",7,14,7,14]]},{"text":"Perfumes burned at — 2Ch 16:14; Jer 34:5.","refs":[["2Chr",16,14,16,14],["Jer",34,5,34,5]]},{"text":"Antiquity of coffins for — Ge 50:26.","refs":[["Gen",50,26,50,26]]},{"text":"Often took place immediately after death — Joh 11:17,39; Ac 5:6,10.","refs":[["John",11,17,11,17],["John",11,39,11,39],["Acts",5,6,5,6],["Acts",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"Of persons embalmed, deferred for seventy days — Ge 50:3,4.","refs":[["Gen",50,3,50,3],["Gen",50,4,50,4]]},{"text":"Of persons hanged, always on the days of execution — De 21:23; Joh 19:31.","refs":[["Deut",21,23,21,23],["John",19,31,19,31]]},{"text":"The right of all nations — Jdj 16:31; Joh 19:38.","refs":[["Judg",16,31,16,31],["John",19,38,19,38]]},{"text":"Of enemies, sometimes performed by the conquerors — 1Ki 11:15; Eze 39:11-14.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,15,11,15],["Ezek",39,11,39,14]]},{"text":"Of the friendless, a kind act — 2Sa 2:5.","refs":[["2Sam",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Natural caves. — Ge 23:19; Joh 11:38.","refs":[["Gen",23,19,23,19],["John",11,38,11,38]]},{"text":"Caves hewn out of rocks. — Isa 22:16; Mt 27:60.","refs":[["Isa",22,16,22,16],["Matt",27,60,27,60]]},{"text":"Gardens. — 2Ki 21:18,26; Joh 19:41.","refs":[["2Kgs",21,18,21,18],["2Kgs",21,26,21,26],["John",19,41,19,41]]},{"text":"Under trees. — Ge 35:8; 1Sa 31:13.","refs":[["Gen",35,8,35,8],["1Sam",31,13,31,13]]},{"text":"Tops of the hills. — Jos 24:33; 2Ki 23:16.","refs":[["Josh",24,33,24,33],["2Kgs",23,16,23,16]]},{"text":"Houses of the deceased. — 1Sa 25:1; 1Ki 2:34.","refs":[["1Sam",25,1,25,1],["1Kgs",2,34,2,34]]},{"text":"The city of David for the kings of Judah. — 1Ki 2:10; 2Ch 21:20; 24:16.","refs":[["1Kgs",2,10,2,10],["2Chr",21,20,21,20],["2Chr",24,16,24,16]]},{"text":"Antiquity of purchasing places for — Ge 23:7-16.","refs":[["Gen",23,7,23,16]]},{"text":"Frequently prepared and pointed out during life. — Ge 50:5; 2Ch 16:14; Mt 27:60.","refs":[["Gen",50,5,50,5],["2Chr",16,14,16,14],["Matt",27,60,27,60]]},{"text":"Members of a family interred in the same. — Ge 25:10; 49:31; 2Sa 2:32.","refs":[["Gen",25,10,25,10],["Gen",49,31,49,31],["2Sam",2,32,2,32]]},{"text":"Held in high veneration. — Ne 2:3,5.","refs":[["Neh",2,3,2,3],["Neh",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Provided for the common people. — Jer 26:23.","refs":[["Jer",26,23,26,23]]},{"text":"Provided for aliens and strangers. — Mt 27:7.","refs":[["Matt",27,7,27,7]]},{"text":"Visited by sorrowing friends. — Joh 11:31.","refs":[["John",11,31,11,31]]},{"text":"Pillars erected on. — Ge 35:20.","refs":[["Gen",35,20,35,20]]},{"text":"Tombs erected over. — Mt 23:27-29.","refs":[["Matt",23,27,23,29]]},{"text":"Sometimes had inscriptions. — 2Ki 23:17.","refs":[["2Kgs",23,17,23,17]]},{"text":"Sometimes not apparent. — Lu 11:44.","refs":[["Luke",11,44,11,44]]},{"text":"For criminals, marked by heaps. — Jos 7:26.","refs":[["Josh",7,26,7,26]]},{"text":"Were ceremonially unclean. — Nu 19:16,18.","refs":[["Num",19,16,19,16],["Num",19,18,19,18]]},{"text":"Often desecrated by idolatry. — Isa 65:3,4.","refs":[["Isa",65,3,65,3],["Isa",65,4,65,4]]},{"text":"The Jews anxious to be interred in their family places of — Ge 47:29-31; 49:29,30; 50:25; 2Sa 19:37.","refs":[["Gen",47,29,47,31],["Gen",49,29,49,29],["Gen",49,30,49,30],["Gen",50,25,50,25],["2Sam",19,37,19,37]]},{"text":"Followed by a feast — 2Sa 3:35; Jer 16:7,8; Ho 9:4.","refs":[["2Sam",3,35,3,35],["Jer",16,7,16,7],["Jer",16,8,16,8],["Hos",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Privation of, considered a calamity — Ec 6:3.","refs":[["Eccl",6,3,6,3]]},{"text":"Privation of, threatened as a punishment — 2Ki 9:10; Jer 8:2; 16:4.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,10,9,10],["Jer",8,2,8,2],["Jer",16,4,16,4]]},{"text":"An ignominious, compared to the burial of an ass — Jer 22:19.","refs":[["Jer",22,19,22,19]]},{"text":"Illustrative of regeneration — Ro 6:4; Col 2:12.","refs":[["Rom",6,4,6,4],["Col",2,12,2,12]]}],"refCount":100}
